{title: Amazing Grace}
{subtitle: Traditional}
{key: G}
{time: 3/4}
{tempo: 80}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
A[G]mazing grace, how [G7]sweet the [C]sound, that [G]saved
A [G]wretch like [Em]me; I [D]once was [D7]lost, but [G]now am [G7]found, was
[C]blind but [D]now I [G]see.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[G]Praise, praise, [C]praise the [G]day
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
'Twas [G]grace that [G7]taught my [C]heart to [G]fear
{end_of_verse}
{chorus}
